{"id":"54c046b8706de870","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-cardinal8-almost-huge-cardinal.md","title":"ZFC Cardinal8 Almost Huge Cardinal","display":"df-zfc-cardinal8-almost-huge-cardinal — ZFC Cardinal8 Almost Huge Cardinal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-cardinal8-almost-huge-cardinal","aliases":["58-df-zfc-cardinal8-almost-huge-cardinal"],"display":"df-zfc-cardinal8-almost-huge-cardinal — ZFC Cardinal8 Almost Huge Cardinal","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-largecard2-almost-huge-cardinal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-cardinal8-almost-huge-cardinal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-cardinal8-almost-huge-cardinal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-cardinal8-almost-huge-cardinal — ZFC Cardinal8 Almost Huge Cardinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"949971542089df67\" href=\"?note=949971542089df67\" title=\"58-df-zfc-largecard2-almost-huge-cardinal\">58-df-zfc-largecard2-almost-huge-cardinal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> (candidate almost huge cardinal)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard2AlmostHugeCardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard2AlmostHugeCardinal}_S\\)</span> (upstream class-level almost-huge scheme, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"949971542089df67\" href=\"?note=949971542089df67\" title=\"58-df-zfc-largecard2-almost-huge-cardinal\">58-df-zfc-largecard2-almost-huge-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCardinal8AlmostHugeCardinal}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCardinal8AlmostHugeCardinal}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> (metalinguistic alias defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{meta}\">\\(\\mathrm{meta}\\)</span> (metalinguistic marker)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cardinal8\\text{-}almost\\text{-}huge\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}} \\mathrm{ZfcCardinal8AlmostHugeCardinal}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcLargecard2AlmostHugeCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cardinal8\\text{-}almost\\text{-}huge\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}} \\mathrm{ZfcCardinal8AlmostHugeCardinal}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcLargecard2AlmostHugeCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Alias of the canonical almost-huge definition; in particular, it uses one elementary embedding with target closed under sequences of length below <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j(\\kappa)\">\\(j(\\kappa)\\)</span>, rather than a supercompact-style quantifier over all targets.</li>\n<li>The upstream scheme quantifies over a proper-class target and a class embedding, so this compatibility name is explicitly metalinguistic.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc